{
  "//": "Golden cases for the two hand-maintained mirrors of the import-time filename validator: FilesystemNameValidator.kt (Kotlin) and FilesystemRules/validateEntryName (Dart, filesystem_type.dart + name_validation.dart), restricted to the two Kind/FilesystemType values the Kotlin side ever validates against: ENCRYPTED_VAULT and UNKNOWN_CONSERVATIVE. See docs/architecture.md ADR-005 item 3 -- these are intentionally kept as two separate implementations, so this file exists to make sure a rule change on one side that isn't mirrored on the other fails a test immediately, in both the Dart and Kotlin unit test suites, without requiring the two to be unified. Loaded by test/core/filesystem/filename_validation_golden_test.dart and FilesystemNameValidatorGoldenTest.kt -- if you add a case here, both suites pick it up automatically.",
